        <mxCell id="U-Jg9Jrtenf92Qa0-zKH-77" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eef3fb;strokeColor=#3b5b8c;dashed=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=4;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;" value="&lt;b&gt;Photo handling&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;MAIN_MENU, ASK_GARMENT_PHOTO, NO_CREDITS, GENERATING, DELIVERED: a photo starts a new catalog (recognise, then CONFIRM_KIND or ASK_GENDER)&lt;br&gt;ASK_EXTRA_PHOTO: the photo fills the next missing slot&lt;br&gt;any other question step: &quot;I wasn&#39;t expecting a photo just now.&quot; + the step again" vertex="1">
